---
description: Repo-wide conventions and quality gate
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the conventions in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

**Default agent work:** focused validation (narrow tests, targeted typecheck/lint,
optional affected checks)—see AGENTS.md **Agent validation**. Pre-commit is fast;
broad affected tests run at push via `gate:pre-push`. Finish without running hooks,
`gate:pre-push`, root `pnpm build`, or `pnpm coverage` unless the user asks for a
commit/checkpoint or push/PR/full validation.

**Repository hooks** ([`.husky/pre-commit`](../../.husky/pre-commit),
[`.husky/pre-push`](../../.husky/pre-push)) run only at those checkpoints.
